"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1 bg-[#eedfc6] border border-[#d4c3ab] text-[#110f0f] px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-semibold text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-tag h-3 w-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"vktsd0\",{\"d\":\"M12.586 2.586A2 2 0 0 0 11.172 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.172a2 2 0 0 0 .586 1.414l8.704 8.704a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 3.42 0l6.58-6.58a2.426 2.426 0 0 0 0-3.42z\"}],[\"$\",\"circle\",\"kqv944\",{\"cx\":\"7.5\",\"cy\":\"7.5\",\"r\":\".5\",\"fill\":\"currentColor\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" Love & Fun\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-calendar h-3 w-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1cmpym\",{\"d\":\"M8 2v4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"4m81vk\",{\"d\":\"M16 2v4\"}],[\"$\",\"rect\",\"1hopcy\",{\"width\":\"18\",\"height\":\"18\",\"x\":\"3\",\"y\":\"4\",\"rx\":\"2\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"8toen8\",{\"d\":\"M3 10h18\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\" February 22, 2026\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight\",\"children\":\"The Science Behind the FLAMES Game: Is It Accurate?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\",\"children\":\"We've all played it in the back of a notebook. But how does FLAMES actually work, and why has it stood the test of time? Let's dive into the algorithm of childhood love.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white border border-[#d4c3ab] rounded-[32px] p-6 md:p-10 shadow-sm\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-white border border-[#d4c3ab] rounded-[32px] p-8 md:p-10 shadow-sm prose prose-neutral max-w-none\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Before dating apps and AI compatibility tests, there was FLAMES. Standing for **Friends, Love, Affection, Marriage, Enemy, Sister**, this simple pen-and-paper game has determined the \\\"destiny\\\" of crushes for decades.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"How the Algorithm Works\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Unlike random zodiac compatibility or complex personality tests, FLAMES is purely mathematical. It relies on the removal of common letters between two names. Here is the step-by-step breakdown:\"}],[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Write down the two names (e.g., ROMEO and JULIET).\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Cross out the common letters found in both names (R, O, E are unique/common depending on the pair).\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Count the remaining letters. Let's say the count is 6.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Using the acronym F-L-A-M-E-S, count to 6 and strike out the letter you land on.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Repeat the process with the remaining letters until only one letter stands.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The last standing letter reveals the relationship status. It's a deterministic algorithm—meaning the result will always be the same for the same pair of names.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Is It Accurate?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Let's be real: FLAMES is for entertainment purposes only. There is no scientific basis that the letters in your name determine your romantic future. However, its accuracy isn't the point. The point is the *hope* and the *fun* of seeing \\\"Love\\\" or \\\"Marriage\\\" pop up.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"It differs significantly from random generators because you can verify the result yourself. You can trace the logic, which gives it a feeling of legitimacy even if it's just a game.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Why Is It Still Popular?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Nostalgia plays a huge role. It's a simple game that requires zero technology, just a pen and paper (or our digital \",[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/flames\",\"children\":\"FLAMES Calculator\"}],\"). It bridges generations—your parents probably played it, and kids today still discover it. If you want a more modern approach, check out our comprehensive \",[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/love-score-guide\",\"children\":\"Love Score Guide\"}],\" to see how names compatibility works.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Plus, it's a low-stakes way to think about a crush. If you get \\\"Enemy,\\\" you can laugh it off. If you get \\\"Marriage,\\\" you can secretly smile.\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"children\":\"Try It Yourself\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Want to see what the algorithm says about you and your crush? You don't need to do the math manually. Use our \",[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/flames\",\"children\":\"FLAMES Calculator\"}],\" to get your result instantly.\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"not-prose mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/flames\",\"children\":\"Calculate FLAMES\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&_svg]:pointer-events-none [&_svg]:size-4 [&_svg]:shrink-0 h-10 w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#110f0f] text-white hover:bg-[#eedfc6] ho